{"title":"2023 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2.1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2.1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Remark\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Remark</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Smart_and_Simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (Smart and Simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CoolMathProblems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CoolMathProblems</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Animated)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Animated)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Magic_Square\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Magic Square</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_harungurcan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by harungurcan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>NASA’s Perseverance Rover was launched on July <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72f1e19ce0046fe93153f4a699dbe21d86fe9b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/9/c49cb68f7a39d116c71338faa7d320152186d1f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2020.$\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> After traveling <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f90a30d5daeccd8fa5e8f1982a055b446ac60b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$292{,}526{,}838$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" /> miles, it landed on Mars in Jezero Crater about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/7314f8133d3b925b9ce6598191d153da7ecdd779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> months later. Which of the following is closest to the Rover’s average interplanetary speed in miles per hour?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/1/0b1d14017f522609f9892e3979377f2e13c7ae13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6{,}000 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 12{,}000 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 60{,}000 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 120{,}000 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 600{,}000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"567\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/7314f8133d3b925b9ce6598191d153da7ecdd779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> months is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/e/cfeba271b618e76bfbb06ee3c294aa25d1ec5f09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5\\cdot30\\cdot24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" /> hours. Therefore, the speed (in miles per hour) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39d951a0814c9962084b6966c14bddc467365df6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{292{,}526{,}838}{6.5\\cdot30\\cdot24} \\approx \\frac{300{,}000{,}000}{6.5\\cdot30\\cdot24} = \\frac{10{,}000{,}000}{6.5\\cdot24} \\approx \\frac{10{,}000{,}000}{6.4\\cdot25} = \\frac{10{,}000{,}000}{160} = 62500 \\approx \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 60{,}000}.\\]\" width=\"740\" height=\"38\" />\nAs the answer choices are far apart from each other, we can ensure that the approximation is correct.\n</p><p>~apex304, SohumUttamchandani, MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2.1\">Solution 2.1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2.1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/d/b1dc56ef1537eacb866f23c0795948b5b0754ae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$292{,}526{,}838 \\approx 300{,}000{,}000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"210\" height=\"17\" /> miles. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/7314f8133d3b925b9ce6598191d153da7ecdd779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> months is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/e/cfeba271b618e76bfbb06ee3c294aa25d1ec5f09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5\\cdot30\\cdot24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" /> hours. Now, we can calculate the speed in miles per hour, which we find is about\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cd20ea8b618574baf611e0fb4c72ac4060d2a98.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{300{,}000{,}000}{6.5\\cdot30\\cdot24}=\\dfrac{10{,}000{,}000}{6.5\\cdot24}=\\dfrac{10{,}000{,}000}{13\\cdot12}=\\dfrac{10{,}000{,}000}{156}\\approx\\dfrac{10{,}000{,}000}{150}\\approx\\dfrac{200{,}000}{3}\\approx\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 60{,}000}.\\]\" width=\"749\" height=\"37\" />\n~MathFun1000\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The rover traveled about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/d/b1dc56ef1537eacb866f23c0795948b5b0754ae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$292{,}526{,}838 \\approx 300{,}000{,}000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"210\" height=\"17\" /> miles. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/7314f8133d3b925b9ce6598191d153da7ecdd779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> months is about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bb3f2d7b0d2d18a76468339aee5a6b639d96c31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\cdot 30 + 15 = 180 + 15 = 195 \\approx 200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"278\" height=\"15\" /> days. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> days is about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/36208d98ddfaff64fcc1c7a93aad917b180f3543.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200\\cdot 24 \\approx 200\\cdot 25 = 5{,}000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"209\" height=\"17\" /> hours. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/1/ff1b8440cbedd9967cc3bb16929065d48eca86c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{300{,}000{,}000}{5{,}000} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 60{,}000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"218\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Remark\">Remark</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Remark\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This problem is a great example of a situation where rounding all the numbers to ones we can easily work with is an excellent first step. In any competitive timed test, especially the AMC, if you see problems that require you to choose answers that are the closest, this is a sign to you that you can speed through this problem and move on quickly. \nThe rounding being: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffd0275eacaa37f5b3146dfd60782e04de0c8db9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{30000000}{200*20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"38\" />\n~Nivaar\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28Smart_and_Simple.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Smart_and_Simple)\">Video Solution by Math-X (Smart and Simple)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (Smart and Simple)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ku_c1YHnLt0?si=qbC0eobIhyCNKboM&amp;t=1647\">https://youtu.be/Ku_c1YHnLt0?si=qbC0eobIhyCNKboM&amp;t=1647</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_CoolMathProblems\">Video Solution by CoolMathProblems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by CoolMathProblems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9WP3LQaMIVg?feature=shared&amp;t=1\">https://youtu.be/9WP3LQaMIVg?feature=shared&amp;t=1</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=637\">https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=637</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/AKJ4XmfYEsA\">https://youtu.be/AKJ4XmfYEsA</a>\n</p><p>~Education the Study of everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AJqTqVLEFnI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AJqTqVLEFnI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Animated.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Animated)\">Video Solution (Animated)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Animated)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/hwR2VM9tHJ0\">https://youtu.be/hwR2VM9tHJ0</a>\n</p><p>~Star League (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://starleague.us\">https://starleague.us</a>)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Magic_Square\">Video Solution by Magic Square</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Magic Square\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-N46BeEKaCQ?t=4695\">https://youtu.be/-N46BeEKaCQ?t=4695</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel